<title>UK: POLL-Extel 1997 survey-technical &amp; chart analysis.</title>
<headline>POLL-Extel 1997 survey-technical &amp; chart analysis.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The weighted rankings of the top 10 technical and chart analysis teams in the 1997 Extel survey are as follows. Votes were weighted according to the size of funds managed by each voter.</p>
<p>1. HSBC James Capel</p>
<p>2. Merrill Lynch</p>
<p>3. Robert Fleming Securities</p>
<p>4. SBC Warburg</p>
<p>5.equal  NatWest Securities</p>
<p>	    Colins Stewart</p>
<p>7. Credit Lyonnais Laing</p>
<p>8.equal  Nomura Research</p>
<p>	    Schroders</p>
<p>	    Daiwa</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 5113</p>
